+XiaobaiHardwareMonitor is based on LibreHardwareMonitor, free and open source software licensed under MPL 2.0. Some parts of the original project are licensed under different terms, see [THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES](https://github.com/LibreHardwareMonitor/LibreHardwareMonitor/blob/master/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt).
